Material adapted from LightCraft and PhotoCraft

Dalica follows the architecture, design tokens, widgets and agent-driven development process of
LightCraft (https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft) and PhotoCraft
(https://github.com/storytold/photocraft), Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the LightCraft
contributors / the PhotoCraft contributors, licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Source revisions used: LightCraft 88ea1a8, PhotoCraft 59684266.

Documentation adapted from them (each file names its sources in its first lines):

  docs/assets.md
  docs/contributing.md
  docs/contributors.md
  docs/control-protocol.md
  docs/faces.md
  docs/formats.md
  docs/localization.md
