Reused code

None yet. Every file vendored from, or crate depended on from, LightCraft or PhotoCraft will be
listed here with its source path and revision, and each vendored file keeps a header comment naming
its origin (docs/architecture.md, section 9).

Third-party material

None bundled yet. Every asset (image, icon, font, sound, data file) will be listed here by family
and per file, with author, source and licence, in ATTRIBUTION.md (rules in docs/assets.md).
